-- usage
Usage: tool --to <dir> [options] <source> [<more>...]
-- help
Usage: tool --to <dir> [options] <source> [<more>...]

Copy things somewhere.

Arguments:
  <source>                 what to copy
  <more>...                more to copy

Options:
      --to <dir>           the directory to copy into (required)
  -v, --verbose            say more
  -j, --jobs <jobs>        how many at once (default: 4)
      --retries <retries>  how often to try again
      --ratio <ratio>      (default: 0.25)
  -m, --mode <fast|safe>   how to copy (default: safe)
  -x, --exclude <exclude>  a pattern to leave out (may be repeated)
  -h, --help               show this help and exit
      --version            show the version and exit
